### List a user's custom policies

List the **custom policies** of the specified user in the specified system (temporary policies and group policies excluded).

#### Parameters

| Field | Type | Location | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| subject_id | string | path | yes | Username |
| system_id | string | query | yes | System ID |
| action_id | string | query | no | Action ID; only policies of this action are returned |

#### Request

```
GET /api/v1/open/admin/subjects/user/zhangsan/policies/?system_id=bk_cmdb
```

#### Response

> Status: 200 OK

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "message": "OK",
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "host_delete",
      "policy_id": 123,
      "type": "delete",
      "name": "删除主机",
      "name_en": "Delete Host",
      "description": "",
      "description_en": "",
      "expired_at": 4102444800,
      "expired_display": "永久",
      "resource_groups": []
    }
  ]
}
```

Field notes:

- `policy_id`: SaaS policy ID
- `id`: action ID
- `resource_groups`: resource condition groups; empty means the action has no related resource instances (pure RBAC policy)
